Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:12.90,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Cobolli, Mensik, Team Europe have a commanding lead in the Laver Cup.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N欧洲队在拉沃尔杯大比分领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.56,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}昨天的单打 科博利打满{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.26,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}输给了勒纳 钱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:18.83,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}今天是最后一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:20.78,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}欧洲队让阿尔卡拉斯歇一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:23.01,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}双打换上他和门西克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.01,0:00:24.41,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}对面的德米纳尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:26.79,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}昨天刚逆转了兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:30.56,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}开局第一局 他们的发球局就被破了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:34.60,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}27{\fs68}号晚上{\fs78}7{\fs68}点多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:35.86,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}拉沃尔杯第三天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:37.59,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}最后一天的第一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:39.89,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 他们又被逼到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:42.79,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}这个破发点救了回来 {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:47.12,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 一路在追
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:49.80,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 他们接发拿到第二个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:52.49,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}科博利在网前握拳 {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:53.88,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}那一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.63,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}德米纳尔和弗里茨连救两个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:59.32,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}第三个盘点 门西克在底线接发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.96,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}一拍抽穿 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.54,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 他们先保住发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:08.67,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}下一局轮到他们接发 {\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:11.52,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}一记重球冲着网前那个人打过去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:14.52,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}第一个破发点就破了 {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:19.17,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}全场他们被拿到{\fs78}6{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:20.61,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}只丢了开局那一个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:21.92,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:23.57,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}发球局一个没丢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:26.11,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 门西克发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.11,0:01:29.68,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68} 赛点 第一个就拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:34.65,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}小时{\fs78}37{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:37.02,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}门西克张开双臂冲着看台
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:40.16,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}队长诺阿和替补席抱成一团
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:52.75,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A standout performance from Team Europe, and in particular Jakub Mensik.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N欧洲队打得出色 尤其是门西克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:56.35,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He was the MVP of this doubles match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他是这场双打的{\fs78}MVP{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.35,0:02:02.05,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Give credit to Cobolli for weathering the early storm.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N开局那阵风暴 科博利扛住了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:03.67,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}赛后 科博利说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.67,0:02:05.70,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}这是他第三年来拉沃尔杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:07.45,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}终于赢下了一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.45,0:02:10.28,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}门西克说 开局他发球找不到节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:13.18,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}前几局他们是场上最差的两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:15.58,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}这一场打完 欧洲队{\fs78}10{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:17.57,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}离{\fs78}13{\fs68}分只差一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.57,0:02:20.23,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}年才等来这一场胜利 明年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:22.62,TL,,0,0,315,,{\an2}你还想看这对组合吗？
